uery\nconst users = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n)\n\n// With filtering and projection\nconst activeUserNames = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n   .where(({ user }) => eq(user.active, true))\n   .select(({ user }) => ({ name: user.name }))\n)","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"call-signature-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call Signature"}]},{"type":"code","value":"function queryOnce<TQuery>(config): Promise<InferResultType<ExtractContext<TQuery>>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts#L83","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts:83"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Executes a one-shot query using a configuration object."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"type-parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"tquery-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TQuery"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQuery"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryBuilder"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"parameters-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"config","children":[{"type":"text","value":"config"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryOnceConfig.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryOnceConfig"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ExtractContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQuery"},{"type":"text","value":">> & "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"object"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configuration object with the query function"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/InferResultType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InferResultType"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ExtractContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TQuery"},{"type":"text","value":">>>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves to an array of query results"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"example-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const recentOrders = await queryOnce({\n  query: (q) =>\n    q.from({ order: ordersCollection })\n     .orderBy(({ order }) => desc(order.createdAt))\n     .limit(100),\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"call-signature","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tqueryfn","text":"TQueryFn","level":4},{"id":"tquery","text":"TQuery","level":4},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"queryfn","text":"queryFn","level":4},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":3},{"id":"call-signature-2","text":"Call Signature","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters-2","text":"Type Parameters","level":3},{"id":"tquery-2","text":"TQuery","level":4},{"id":"parameters-2","text":"Parameters","level":3},{"id":"config","text":"config","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOnce<TQueryFn, TQuery>(queryFn): Promise<InferResultType<ExtractContext<TQuery>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts:59](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts#L59)\n\nExecutes a one-shot query and returns the results as an array.\n\nThis function creates a live query collection, preloads it, extracts the results,\nand automatically cleans up the collection. It's ideal for:\n- AI/LLM context building\n- Data export\n- Background processing\n- Testing\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFn\n\n`TQueryFn` *extends* (`q`) => [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n#### TQuery\n\n`TQuery` *extends* [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\> = `ReturnType`\\<`TQueryFn`\\>\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### queryFn\n\n`TQueryFn` & `RootQueryFn`\\<`TQuery`\\>\n\nA function that receives the query builder and returns a query\n\n### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`InferResultType`](../type-aliases/InferResultType.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\>\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of query results\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\n// Basic query\nconst users = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n)\n\n// With filtering and projection\nconst activeUserNames = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n   .where(({ user }) => eq(user.active, true))\n   .select(({ user }) => ({ name: user.name }))\n)\n```\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOnce<TQuery>(config): Promise<InferResultType<ExtractContext<TQuery>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts:83](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts#L83)\n\nExecutes a one-shot query using a configuration object.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQuery\n\n`TQuery` *extends* [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### config\n\n[`QueryOnceConfig`](../interfaces/QueryOnceConfig.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\> & `object`\n\nConfiguration object with the query function\n\n### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`InferResultType`](../type-aliases/InferResultType.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\>\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of query results\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nconst recentOrders = await queryOnce({\n  query: (q) =>\n    q.from({ order: ordersCollection })\n     .orderBy(({ order }) => desc(order.createdAt))\n     .limit(100),\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: queryOnce\ntitle: queryOnce\n---\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOnce<TQueryFn, TQuery>(queryFn): Promise<InferResultType<ExtractContext<TQuery>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts:59](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts#L59)\n\nExecutes a one-shot query and returns the results as an array.\n\nThis function creates a live query collection, preloads it, extracts the results,\nand automatically cleans up the collection. It's ideal for:\n- AI/LLM context building\n- Data export\n- Background processing\n- Testing\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQueryFn\n\n`TQueryFn` *extends* (`q`) => [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n#### TQuery\n\n`TQuery` *extends* [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\> = `ReturnType`\\<`TQueryFn`\\>\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### queryFn\n\n`TQueryFn` & `RootQueryFn`\\<`TQuery`\\>\n\nA function that receives the query builder and returns a query\n\n### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`InferResultType`](../type-aliases/InferResultType.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\>\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of query results\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\n// Basic query\nconst users = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n)\n\n// With filtering and projection\nconst activeUserNames = await queryOnce((q) =>\n  q.from({ user: usersCollection })\n   .where(({ user }) => eq(user.active, true))\n   .select(({ user }) => ({ name: user.name }))\n)\n```\n\n## Call Signature\n\n```ts\nfunction queryOnce<TQuery>(config): Promise<InferResultType<ExtractContext<TQuery>>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts:83](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/query-once.ts#L83)\n\nExecutes a one-shot query using a configuration object.\n\n### Type Parameters\n\n#### TQuery\n\n`TQuery` *extends* [`QueryBuilder`](../type-aliases/QueryBuilder.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n### Parameters\n\n#### config\n\n[`QueryOnceConfig`](../interfaces/QueryOnceConfig.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\> & `object`\n\nConfiguration object with the query function\n\n### Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<[`InferResultType`](../type-aliases/InferResultType.md)\\<[`ExtractContext`](../type-aliases/ExtractContext.md)\\<`TQuery`\\>\\>\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to an array of query results\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nconst recentOrders = await queryOnce({\n  query: (q) =>\n    q.from({ order: ordersCollection })\n     .orderBy(({ order }) => desc(order.createdAt))\n     .limit(100),\n})\n```\n"}
